\title{dmai: Divisia monetary aggregates index}
\description{
The \pkg{dmai} package builds monetary aggregates from their components (currency, demand deposits, savings and
time deposits, ...) by the methods of index number theory. The Divisia index of Barnett (1980) weights every
component by its share in the expenditure on monetary services, priced by its user cost (Barnett 1978); the
package also gives the Fisher ideal index, a variant with simple growth rates, the simple sum and the currency
equivalent index, the dual user-cost price index and the Divisia second moments.
}
